# Files that must never be uploaded by `vercel deploy` (Round 2 preview, CLI deployment from this folder).
# Secrets and local environment files: configuration comes ONLY from Vercel Project Settings → Environment
# Variables (Preview). .env.local points at the ORIGINAL Supabase project and must never reach a deployment.
.env*
!.env.example

# Local-only tooling, agent worktrees, generated artefacts
.claude
restore-dev
backup
graphify-out
.next
node_modules
coverage
*.tsbuildinfo

# Not needed at runtime
tests
docs
supabase/hosted-apply
fixtures/parser
